# The boundary of "one or fewer cards in hand": with exactly two cards in every hand the Temple of the Dead is refused, and
# after Bot1 plays a Swamp it has exactly one and the same activation works (so the refusal is the hand size, nothing else).
# Aclazotz died on Bot2's turn 2 (two Lightning Bolts) and came back tapped as the Temple. Bot1's hand: the Swamp left after
# turn 1 plus its turn-3 draw (the second Swamp) = 2; Bot2's is four cards.

